  "user_request_original": "Design a multilayer dielectric stack with air incidence on fused silica substrate. Stack: SiO2 (Lemarchand) AR layer at air interface, followed by 9 alternating pairs of HfO2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) (starting with HfO2), followed by SiO2 (Lemarchand) AR layer at substrate interface (20 layers total). Optimize the two AR layer thicknesses and the Bragg quarter-wave reference wavelength to maximize transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band while maximizing reflectance in 400-700 nm band. Layer count fixed at 20. Materials: hfo2, SiO2 (Lemarchand).",
